msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If your service has an admin console, it's a nice pattern to publish a link "
"to it in the Dev UI.\n"
"With the old Dev Services model, you might customise your extensions's card "
"with code something like this:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This will no longer work, because the url isn't known at build time.\n"
"Instead, replace the `url` method with `dynamicUrlJsonRPCMethodName`, link:/"
"guides/dev-ui#runtime-external-links[passing in an RPC method name]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"From 3.32, you can also pass through parameters on the method call. For "
"example,"
msgstr ""

msgid "Add a build step to register the providing class:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In your extension's runtime module, create a `MyJsonRPCService` class with a "
"`getMyUrl` method."
msgstr ""

